# Spanish UI Terminology

Use this glossary for all Spanish (`es`) user-facing copy in `lib/i18n.ts` and the UI.

| English | Spanish UI |
| --- | --- |
| Asset | Activo Musical |
| Musical Work | Obra Musical |
| License | Licencia |
| Royalty | Regalía |
| Settlement | Liquidación |
| Listing | Publicación |
| Protocol | Protocolo |
| Marketplace | Marketplace |
| SDK | SDK |
| Wallet (UI) | Cuenta |
| Session | Sesión |
| Ownership | Propiedad |
| Publish | Publicar |
| Purchase | Compra |
| Developer / Builder | Desarrollador |
| Core Protocol | Núcleo del Protocolo |
| Blockchain Adapter (UI) | Adaptador de Liquidación |
| Settlement Layer | Capa de Liquidación |

Never show users: Wallet Address, Transaction Hash, Gas, RPC, Signer, Nonce.
Prefer: Cuenta, Propiedad, Pago, Liquidación, Actividad, Historial.

## SDK method names

Never translate technical SDK / API identifiers.

```text
UI:  Publicar Obra
Code: sdk.publishAsset()   ✅
Code: sdk.publicarObra()   ❌
```

Keep method names, port names, and package identifiers in English in code samples and monospace UI (e.g. `connectWallet`, `validateRoyaltySplits`, `ISettlement`).
